 {
  "name": "journal-style entry",
  "markdown": "Today I fixed the gallery.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Photos load **faster**\n- Captions use _italics_\n\nRead [the notes](/writing/notes \"Notes\").\n\n![The new gallery](/media/gallery.jpg)",
  "html": "<p>Today I fixed the gallery.</p>\n<h2>What changed</h2>\n<ul><li>Photos load <strong>faster</strong></li><li>Captions use <em>italics</em></li></ul>\n<p>Read <a href=\"/writing/notes\" title=\"Notes\">the notes</a>.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"The new gallery\" src=\"/media/gallery.jpg\"></p>"
 },
